    "text": "<p>For the given input and output, truth table is given below.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6f5c1a41-12be-426e-b121-1ca32370e457-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 179px;\" /></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Input A</td>\t\t\t<td>Input B</td>\t\t\t<td>Output</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>1</td>\t\t\t<td>1</td>\t\t\t<td>0</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>0</td>\t\t\t<td>1</td>\t\t\t<td>1</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>1</td>\t\t\t<td>0</td>\t\t\t<td>1</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>0</td>\t\t\t<td>0</td>\t\t\t<td>1</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Clearly, it is a NAND gate. Therefore, the answer is B.</p>",
